  "title": "Raisin Butter Tarts",
  "description": "These diminutive sweet tarts are made from brown sugar, lemon juice, melted butter, egg, lots of raisins and a smidgen of nutmeg. They bake up golden and delicious. Serve with a dollop of whipped cream.",
  "authors": [
    "Carol"
